			"notes": "- Updated to Minecraft Fabric 26.2\n- Fixed an exploit allowing diamonds to be crafted with only 64 graphite instead of the required 128.\n- Fixed packed ice consuming only 36 water items instead of the required 144.\n- Fixed dissolver outputs exceeding item stack limits. Large outputs now split into valid stacks without losing items.\n- Improved combiner handling of repeated ingredients with different required quantities.\n- Added four regression tests covering ingredient consumption and output stacking.\n- Temporarily added a custom book tutorial while Patchouli is awaiting an update."
		},
